The widget turns the proof into a geometric journey from coincidence to the antipode. For background, see [stereographic projection](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stereographic_projection) and the [unit sphere](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Unit_sphere).

{{visualization:0}}

## Audit a finite attention row

The direct evaluator computes each squared distance, converts it to a Cauchy weight, and counts scores at least the threshold.

